<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Linear Tech EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Linear Tech EPS raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Scott Randall raised his earnings per share estimates on Linear Technology Corp.</p>
<p>-- raised fiscal 1998 to $2.17 from $2.09 and boosted fiscal 1999 to $2.70 from $2.60.</p>
<p>-- kept short- and long-term buy ratings on the stock.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3-3/4 to 62-1/4.</p>
</text>
